  "title": "Calvary Communications & Design Request",
  "description": "One form for every communications and design request. Every request is reviewed, assigned a tier, and scheduled. Remember our rule: One Story + One Next Step.\n\nHow much time we need for Promoting an event or ministry: \nLevel 1 Ministry/Event: At least 12 weeks out\nLevel 2 Ministry/Event: At least 5-7 weeks out\nLevel 3 Ministry/Event: At least 5-7 weeks out\nLevel 4 Ministry/Event: At least 3 weeks out\nSermon series: At least 10 weeks before the series starts.\nGraphic design only: At least 3 weeks before you need the final design.\nNeed it sooner? Submit anyway and say comment that in the form. We will do our best, but rushed requests may get a lighter plan or unable to fulfill request.",
